{"id":"f6981f85f6559c7c","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-prop-tychonoff.md","title":"Tychonoff's Theorem","display":"prop-tychonoff — Tychonoff's Theorem","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-tychonoff","aliases":["58-prop-tychonoff"],"display":"prop-tychonoff — Tychonoff's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space]]","[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-tychonoff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-tychonoff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-tychonoff — Tychonoff's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"642e1f3e8606bd5d\" href=\"?note=642e1f3e8606bd5d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space\">58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(X_i,\\tau_i)\\mid i\\in I\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(X_i,\\tau_i)\\mid i\\in I\\rangle\\)</span> (family of topological spaces)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\prod_{i\\in I}X_i\">\\(X=\\prod_{i\\in I}X_i\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\prod}\">\\(\\tau_{\\prod}\\)</span> (product topology, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\)</span> (product-topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (compact-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"642e1f3e8606bd5d\" href=\"?note=642e1f3e8606bd5d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space\">58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tychonoff}\\vdash\n\\forall I\\,\\forall\\langle(X_i,\\tau_i)\\mid i\\in I\\rangle\\,\n\\forall X\\,\\forall\\tau_{\\prod}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\n\\bigl(I,\\langle X_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_i:i\\in I\\rangle,X,\\tau_{\\prod}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X_i,\\tau_i)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau_{\\prod})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tychonoff}\\vdash\n\\forall I\\,\\forall\\langle(X_i,\\tau_i)\\mid i\\in I\\rangle\\,\n\\forall X\\,\\forall\\tau_{\\prod}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\n\\bigl(I,\\langle X_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_i:i\\in I\\rangle,X,\\tau_{\\prod}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X_i,\\tau_i)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau_{\\prod})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology on the product is essential; compactness is not a property of the carrier sets alone.</li>\n<li>The full arbitrary-product theorem is equivalent over ZF to the axiom of choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space","status":"resolved","id":"642e1f3e8606bd5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\prod}$ (product topology, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S$ (product-topology predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space","status":"resolved","id":"642e1f3e8606bd5d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S$ (compact-space predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top6-compact-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle(X_i,\\tau_i)\\mid i\\in I\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\prod_{i\\in I}X_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\prod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tychonoff}\\vdash\n\\forall I\\,\\forall\\langle(X_i,\\tau_i)\\mid i\\in I\\rangle\\,\n\\forall X\\,\\forall\\tau_{\\prod}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\n\\bigl(I,\\langle X_i:i\\in I\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_i:i\\in I\\rangle,X,\\tau_{\\prod}\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X_i,\\tau_i)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop6CompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau_{\\prod})","display":true}],"bytes":1408,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4007","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-prop-tychonoff.md|58-prop-tychonoff]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["5260a5349d0b732f","642e1f3e8606bd5d","b3dac4cf78c440c7"]}